OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CPolice officers discovered Chloe       
OL,5,CMitchell's remains in bins, court hears
OL,6,GThis article contains details that     
OL,7,Gsome may find distressing              
OL,9,FPolice and forensics officers have     
OL,10,Ftold a court how they discovered the   
OL,11,Fdismembered remains of Chloe Mitchell  
OL,12,Fin bins.                               
OL,14,FBrandon Rainey, formerly of James      
OL,15,FStreet in Ballymena, is on trial       
OL,16,Faccused of murdering Chloe and         
OL,17,Fpreventing the lawful burial of her    
OL,18,Fremains, which he denies.              
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
