OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CMan in his 80s dies after house fire   
OL,5,GA man in his 80s has died following a  
OL,6,Ghouse fire in Omagh, County Tyrone.    
OL,8,FPolice said they were alerted to the   
OL,9,Fblaze at a property in Crevenagh Downs 
OL,10,Fat about 15:40 GMT on Thursday, with   
OL,11,F"a report of a person potentially      
OL,12,Ftrapped".                              
OL,14,F"Upon arrival officers entered the     
OL,15,Fproperty," the Police Service of       
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) said.          
OL,18,F"The man was then removed from the     
OL,19,Fhouse and given CPR by attending       
OL,20,Fpolice and other emergency service     
OL,21,Fpersonnel, however tragically he did   
OL,22,Fnot survive."                     G2/4 
