OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CConcern over maternity unit move       
OL,5,Cprompts extra paramedic funding        
OL,6,GExtra paramedic shifts are to be       
OL,7,Gfunded to relieve pressure on          
OL,8,Gambulances after the suspension of     
OL,9,Gmaternity services at Newry's Daisy    
OL,10,GHill Hospital, MLAs have heard.        
OL,12,FOn Monday, the Southern Health Trust   
OL,13,Fmoved all of its hospital-based births 
OL,14,Fto Craigavon Area Hospital because of  
OL,15,Fa shortage of consultant               
OL,16,Fobstretricians.                        
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
